# Copy to .env — that file is gitignored. Bun loads it for every `bun run`.
# Nothing is required in development; these default as shown.
#
# DATA_DIR=./data
# PORT=9966
#
# The household password's hash, from `bun run password`. Without it the dev
# server needs no login (and says so); a production build refuses to start.
# Bun expands `$` in .env even inside quotes, so escape each one as `\$`:
# EXPECTING_PASSWORD_HASH=\$argon2id\$v=19\$m=65536,t=2,p=1\$...
